# 5E Lab's effects' bindings for `coax wgsl apps/openagents-web/gpu/fivelab-fx.coax` (coax/web/wgsl-module.coax):
# NAME GROUP BINDING, and `uniform COUNT` for a []f32 read as a uniform block of COUNT vec4fs.
# They are coax/web/host.js's particlePipeline layouts: group 0 fivelab.wgsl's uniforms, read up
# to the camera's up (32 floats, 8 vec4fs); group 1 the puffs.
u 0 0 uniform 8
puffs 1 0
